<title>USA: Cable Link Inc Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Cable Link Inc Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months Ending March 31</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $2,211,517     $2,719,210</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)			   126,052	  201,289</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding			1,408,926	1,258,926</p>
<p> Net Earnings (Loss) Per Share		0.09	     0.16</p>
<p>NOTE:  Company said net earnings and number of shares are restated to reflect a 20 percent stock dividend effective May 6, 1996 and a three-for-two stock split effective Jan 21.</p>
<p>Company said current share totals reflect the purchase of 150,000 post-split shares by Axxess International Group.</p>
